# Environment variables
.env*
# Committed, self-contained region config (native identity + JS/runtime values).
# Each is copied to `.env` by the build scripts and BOTH are embedded by
# app.config.ts as extra.regionConfigs so the single iOS binary resolves region
# at runtime. The active `.env` (a copy of one of these) stays ignored.
!.env.global.example
!.env.cn.example
